<div class="size"><b>6x6</b><h3>Mini challenge</h3><p>Two-by-three boxes make a friendly step up, quick enough for a coffee break.</p></div>
<div class="size"><b>9x9</b><h3>Classic grid</h3><p>The world-famous layout with six levels from Easy to Mad Bunny.</p></div>
<div class="size"><b>X</b><h3>Bunny Sudoku X</h3><p>Paw-print diagonals add a twist once the classic feels comfortable.</p></div>
</div>
