<p class="sub">Teachers, parents and carers can use Sudoku in many small ways.</p>
<div class="class">
<div><b>Morning starter</b>Hand out a 4x4 sheet while the class settles and talk through one deduction together.</div>
<div><b>Quiet-time activity</b>Printable packs with answer keys let children check their own work.</div>
<div><b>Family puzzle night</b>Solve the Daily together. Everyone plays the same board, so you can compare tricks.</div>
<div><b>Travel kit</b>Print a few blank grids and puzzles, then toss them in the bag with a pencil.</div>
